1350
01:26:19,340 --> 01:26:25,340
WE LEAVE MASS OUT IN ALL WEATHER, ALL YEAR, IN SOME CASES.

1351
01:26:25,340 --> 01:26:30,340
AND THAT MAKES THEM DRY UP AND BE, YOU KNOW, HARD TO SUSTAIN.

1352
01:26:30,340 --> 01:26:34,340
AND YOU DON'T WANT TO HAVE THE PEOPLE COMPETING ON AFTER A WHILE.

1353
01:26:34,340 --> 01:26:41,340
SO IF YOU WANT YOUR EQUIPMENT TO LAST, YOU NEED TO HAVE A STORAGE AREA THAT'S SUITABLE FOR IT.

1354
